{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining Survivors is an incremental game in which you mine resources whilst fending of swarms of enemies in a bullet-heaven environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.poster.avif?t=1770422298\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.webm?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/0529911b3d01f502e39127533bd0dba9.mp4?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You mine resources in short bursts, before either dying to enemies or fending them off long enough to escape with extra rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You then return to the shop, where you spend your resources to upgrade your character and unlock new levels and areas to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.poster.avif?t=1770422298\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.webm?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322450/extras/99872caa8233fed7796dea23de049a8a.mp4?t=1770422298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay / Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Heaven combat against enemy hordes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine rocks to gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources on upgrades and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory of weapons and mods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New territories to unlock as you progress</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Evacuate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/dc852697d89e8e59611993cbea07c1a16ee4112e.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Planet 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/72f25a89c471d379420e00e830129fcb055a4315.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Planet 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/07e6f3be03d6dc2d4bd6d09004e2bf0942f7868b.jpg"},{"name":"Destroy Carrier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/9fd3ffbea16fc15a790e8ff8cce7dbb6ff38d37b.jpg"},{"name":"Prestige","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/898ee165966ae33246e883979198f6bbf3f06adf.jpg"},{"name":"Build Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/f5d293fc3d266dc2f2fd6f6cb77fa6e00b662a19.jpg"},{"name":"Build Rocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/097b12ad1aa707a1355fcbf377d42b4f568f72b4.jpg"},{"name":"Kill a Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/543eacd7f8680b75e002bf9c2484b3368561e8af.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Roguelike Difficulty 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/da3b50e6a031b1e3acce3c17f0bd1a1f5d8b1fcc.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Roguelike Difficulty 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2322450/5f1f2d19443ebcaa60ff80b3b6f9f1a11c4b9aea.jpg"}],"tota